 },
 "structural_change": "e2 rw4c = rw4 with glue root clk_c folded into clk (wire clk_c = clk in the new top). rw4 --cts gate 91d749022 FAIL: clk_c 291 sinks over 535x472 um, TritonCTS H-tree depth 14, boundary pin-flop spread 432.1 ps TT, while clk (878 sinks) held 37.6 ps. One balanced clk tree; logic, register ages, data/reset ABI unchanged; parent no longer drives clk_c.",
